              "en": "Molds are built from drawings or samples; for samples, 3D scanning and reverse modeling come first, and mold making starts after the drawing is confirmed."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "trial-molding",
            "title": {
              "zh": "试模",
              "en": "Trial molding"
            },
            "body": {
