        "items": [
          {
            "id": "faq-sample-mold",
            "title": {
              "zh": "没有图纸只有样品能开模吗？",
              "en": "Can you build a mold from a sample without drawings?"
            },
            "body": {
              "zh": "可以，先做 3D 扫描和逆向建模，图纸确认后再开模。",
              "en": "Yes. 3D scanning and reverse modeling come first, and mold making starts after the drawing is confirmed."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "faq-mold-leadtime",
            "title": {
              "zh": "开模周期多久？",
              "en": "How long does mold making take?"
            },
            "body": {
              "zh": "单腔模具约 25–35 天，多腔热流道和双色模具约 40–55 天，从图纸确认开始计。",
              "en": "About 25–35 days for a single-cavity mold and about 40–55 days for multi-cavity hot-runner and two-shot molds, counted from drawing confirmation."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "faq-t1-samples",
            "title": {
              "zh": "试模样品怎么提供？",
              "en": "How are trial samples provided?"
            },
            "body": {
              "zh": "T1 试模后 3 天内寄出样品和全尺寸检测报告，每套模具含 3 次试模。",
              "en": "Samples and a full-dimension inspection report are shipped within 3 days after T1 trial molding; each mold includes 3 trial runs."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "faq-mold-ownership",
            "title": {
              "zh": "模具归谁所有？",
              "en": "Who owns the mold?"
            },
            "body": {
              "zh": "模具费付清后模具归买方所有，可存放在本厂用于批量生产。",
              "en": "After the mold cost is paid in full, the mold belongs to the buyer and can be stored at our plant for volume production."
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "faq-trade-terms",
            "title": {
              "zh": "出口订单用什么贸易条款？",
              "en": "Which trade terms are used for export orders?"
            },
            "body": {
              "zh": "常用 FOB 宁波和 EXW，也可按订单约定 CIF。",
              "en": "FOB Ningbo and EXW are common; CIF can be agreed per order."
            }
          }
        ]
      },
